<title>CHINA: China to expand mainland bank operations in HK.</title>
<headline>China to expand mainland bank operations in HK.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>China will expand the operations of mainland-based financial operations in Hong Kong after the handover of the territory from Britain, the official Business News reported on Thursday.</p>
<p>The newspaper said China wanted to make greater use of Hong Kong's position as an international financial centre to help train financial industry personnel for work on the mainland.</p>
<p>&quot;The People's Bank of China intends to expand the operations of China-invested financial institutions in Hong Kong,&quot; it quoted a People's Bank official as saying.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
